~ start
We're all here.
Nanay. Tatay. Ate Valerie. Kuya Dodong. Noni. Kiki.
Everyone is here.
…
Kuya Dodong is hurt. The doctors said his leg couldn't be saved.
He doesn't play with his Gameboy much anymore.
Ate Valerie helps Nanay take care of Kiki and Noni.
Noni holds my hand whenever the rain gets loud.
Kiki cries whenever it rains, so Nanay holds her close.
And Tatay…
He doesn't talk much now.
Sometimes, I see him looking at nothing.
I think he's sad, too.
But we're all still here.
…
Our house is gone.
My toys, too.
I miss my bed.
I miss when rain was just rain.
But everyone's here.
That's good, right?
…
It was my birthday.
I'm eight now…
I wish we could've celebrated at home.

OLLIE:
Nay, can we go home someday?

NANAY:
We'll find our way, anak.

OLLIE:
Okay.
I'll wait.
We'll find our way home.
=> END